                  "A flagging threshold applied consistently across all peer groups surfaces which specific groups warrant deeper investigation.",
                  "A flagged gap based on a very small sample size (here, one woman) still warrants investigation, but with an explicitly lower confidence level than the same percentage gap in a larger group.",
