                "v": "Option A: A single 90-minute all-manager training webinar covering structure, disclosure boundaries, and common Q&A, recorded for reference.\nOption B: A written briefing pack emailed to each manager individually, with talking points and disclosure guidance, no live session.\nOption C: A hybrid — a shorter 30-minute live session covering disclosure boundaries and the most sensitive scenarios, paired with a detailed written briefing pack for reference and self-paced review of structural details."
