                "t": "p",
                "v": "Almont chose Option C. Three months after rollout, a survey of managers found 89% felt confident discussing range mechanics, but only 61% felt confident handling a same-team pay comparison question like the one practised in Module 3's exercise. What does this gap suggest?"
