    "total_xp": 3030,
    "desc": "A practitioner-grade course in designing, governing, and communicating short-term incentive plans that actually change behaviour — from eligibility and metric design through to payout curves, governance gates, and year-end administration. Includes worked exercises, case studies across the Rewardology fictional organisations, and a full plan design capstone.",
