                "v": "Directors (12 roles): 25% target bonus. Rationale: highest direct impact on strategy execution; equity-level alignment expected by new ownership.\nSenior Managers (18 roles): 15% target bonus. Rationale: meaningful variable element reflecting team-level accountability.\nSpecialist Leads (10 roles): 10% target bonus. Rationale: important creative and operational contributors with more indirect revenue impact.\nRoles below this level: excluded initially. The new plan shouldn't be over-extended before a communication and governance infrastructure exists."
