                "v": "Single figure of remuneration (each director, per year)\nCEO pay ratio vs employee workforce (P25, P50, P75)\nLTI performance outcomes — were conditions met and at what vesting level\nSalary increases — CEO increase vs workforce average increase\nShareholder engagement — actions taken in response to prior year vote outcomes"
