                  "The 60/30/10 distribution target (60% at or above quota in a good year) is the primary diagnostic for whether quotas are correctly calibrated.",
                  "Territory equalisation creates comparable difficulty across reps — without it, quota attainment becomes a measure of portfolio quality rather than individual performance."
