                "v": "Nova Tech is hiring 20 employees in Nairobi and 15 in Accra simultaneously with its Lagos operations, targeting a 90-day full-team operational start. The Head of People has survey data for Nairobi but no published survey data for Accra. Both markets have statutory requirements different from Nigeria. The 90-day timeline means compensation structures must be finalised in week 2 of the hiring process."
